name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q15_2025'

question 'A student is testing their interactive story app. When they press a button, nothing happens. They ask an AI assistant for help, and it suggests changing one line of code. What\'s the most responsible next step before accepting the AI\'s fix?'

right 'Test the change and check if it actually fixes the issue without breaking other parts of the app.'
wrong 'Replace the entire code with the AI\'s version to be safe.'
wrong 'Copy and paste the AI\'s answer immediately so they can move on faster.'
wrong 'Delete the button from the app since it\'s not working correctly anyway.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

